---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Resources" description="Find support options in your country. Crisis support, ADHD education, professional directories and more." current="resources">

  <section class="resources">
    <div class="resources-inner">
      <p class="resources-label">Support</p>
      <h1 class="resources-title">Need more <em>support?</em></h1>
      <p class="resources-body">ADHD Reflect can help you understand hard parenting moments, repair after conflict and practise small changes. But sometimes a guide is not enough.</p>
      <p class="resources-body">If the same pattern keeps happening, if you feel overwhelmed, or if you are worried about safety, these resources may help you find the next right step.</p>

      <!-- Safety block - always first -->
      <div class="safety-block">
        <h2>If someone may be unsafe</h2>
        <p>If you are worried you may hurt yourself, your child or someone else, step away if safe and contact emergency services or a crisis support service in your country.</p>
        <p>ADHD Reflect does not provide crisis care.</p>
        <div class="crisis-numbers">
          <div class="crisis-country">
            <h3>Australia</h3>
            <p>Emergency: <strong>000</strong></p>
            <p>Lifeline: <strong>13 11 14</strong> (24/7)</p>
            <p>Parentline: <strong>1300 301 300</strong></p>
            <p>Kids Helpline: <strong>1800 551 800</strong></p>
          </div>
          <div class="crisis-country">
            <h3>United States</h3>
            <p>Emergency: <strong>911</strong></p>
            <p>988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline: <strong>988</strong></p>
            <p>Crisis Text Line: text <strong>HOME</strong> to <strong>741741</strong></p>
          </div>
          <div class="crisis-country">
            <h3>United Kingdom</h3>
            <p>Emergency: <strong>999</strong></p>
            <p>Samaritans: <strong>116 123</strong> (24/7)</p>
            <p>NSPCC: <strong>0808 800 5000</strong></p>
          </div>
          <div class="crisis-country">
            <h3>New Zealand</h3>
            <p>Emergency: <strong>111</strong></p>
            <p>Need to Talk: <strong>1737</strong> (24/7)</p>
            <p>Parentline: <strong>0800 568 856</strong></p>
          </div>
          <div class="crisis-country">
            <h3>Canada</h3>
            <p>Emergency: <strong>911</strong></p>
            <p>Talk Suicide Canada: <strong>988</strong></p>
            <p>Crisis Text Line: text <strong>HOME</strong> to <strong>686868</strong></p>
          </div>
          <div class="crisis-country">
            <h3>Ireland</h3>
            <p>Emergency: <strong>112</strong> or <strong>999</strong></p>
            <p>Samaritans: <strong>116 123</strong> (24/7)</p>
            <p>Parentline: <strong>1890 927 277</strong></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Coming soon sections -->
      <div class="coming-soon-block">
        <h2>More support options coming soon</h2>
        <p>We're building a country-specific support directory covering ADHD education, professional directories, coaching options and practical parenting support. The goal is to help you find the next right step, not sell you something.</p>
        <p>For now, if you need support beyond what a guide can offer, your GP or family doctor is usually the safest first step.</p>
        <p>Questions or suggestions: <a href="mailto:hello@adhdreflect.com">hello@adhdreflect.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .resources {
    padding: 64px 0 96px;
  }
  .resources-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .resources-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .resources-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 48;
  }
  .resources-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  .resources-body {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--pewter);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .safety-block {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(201,123,106,0.2);
  }
  .safety-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .safety-block > p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--pewter);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .crisis-numbers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .crisis-country {
    padding: 16px;
    background: var(--cloud);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .crisis-country h3 {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .crisis-country p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--pewter);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .crisis-country strong {
    color: var(--slate);
  }

  .coming-soon-block {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--mist);
    border-radius: 16px;
  }
  .coming-soon-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .coming-soon-block p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--pewter);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .coming-soon-block a {
    color: var(--blue);
  }
</style>

